# EmailJS Contact Form

Contact submissions go through EmailJS — no custom API routes.

## Setup

```env
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
```

## Component Pattern

- Live in `components/forms/ContactForm.tsx` with `"use client"`
- Use `@emailjs/browser` `sendForm()` — field `name` attrs must match template variables
- States: idle → sending → success | error
- On error, show fallback: phone (801) 694-5910 and Info@trueridgeconstruct.com
- Reset form on success; disable submit button while sending
- Consider honeypot field for spam; add reCAPTCHA if spam increases

```tsx
await emailjs.sendForm(serviceId, templateId, formRef.current, { publicKey });
```

## Fields

Match current site: `from_name`, `phone`, `from_email`, `message`
